1
00:04:02,857 --> 00:04:08,857
Alien Tornado is a science fiction, action, thriller film directed by Jeff Burr.

2
00:08:05,714 --> 00:08:11,714
Aliens attack Earth with deadly electrical tornadoes, and it’s up to a farmer, his smart
high-school daughter and a tornado blogger to thwart the horrific invasion.

3
00:12:08,571 --> 00:12:14,571
Gail Curtis, played by Kari Wührer.

4
00:16:11,428 --> 00:16:17,428
Kelly Walker, played by Stacey Asaro.

5
00:20:14,285 --> 00:20:20,285
Judd Walker, played by Jeff Fahey.

6
00:24:17,142 --> 00:24:23,142
Street Fighter (uncredited), played by Chip Haw.

7
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:26,000
Armstrong, played by David Jensen.

8
00:32:22,857 --> 00:32:28,857
DJ (uncredited), played by Mike Kimmel.

9
00:36:25,714 --> 00:36:31,714
Alien: Romulus is a 2024 science fiction horror film directed by Fede
Álvarez, who co-wrote the script with Rodo Sayagues.

10
00:40:28,571 --> 00:40:34,571
It is the seventh installment in the Alien film series, set
between the events of Alien (1979) and Aliens (1986).

11
00:44:31,428 --> 00:44:37,428
The film stars Cailee Spaeny, David Jonsson, Archie Renaux, Isabela Merced, Spike Fearn, and Aileen Wu as six downtrodden young space
colonists who encounter hostile creatures while scavenging a derelict space station in which they plan to navigate to another planet.

12
00:48:34,285 --> 00:48:40,285
At CinemaCon in April 2019, 20th Century Studios (then-named 20th
Century Fox) announced plans to produce future Alien films.

13
00:52:37,142 --> 00:52:43,142
Álvarez was attached as director in March 2022, and
Spaeny joined as the lead later that year.

14
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
Filming took place from March to July 2023.

15
01:00:42,857 --> 01:00:48,857
Alien: Romulus premiered in Los Angeles on August 12, 2024, and was theatrically
released in the United States by 20th Century Studios on August 16.

16
01:04:45,714 --> 01:04:51,714
The film grossed $350.9 million worldwide and received
generally positive reviews from critics.

17
01:08:48,571 --> 01:08:54,571
It received several industry nominations, namely for its technical aspects,
including an Academy Award nomination for Best Visual Effects.

18
01:12:51,428 --> 01:12:57,428
A sequel is in development.

19
01:16:54,285 --> 01:17:00,285
The film explores themes of tornado, alien, alien invasion.

20
01:20:57,142 --> 01:21:03,142
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
